<title>JAPAN: Toyota 1996 domestic output up 7.5% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Toyota 1996 domestic output up 7.5% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Monday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas ouptut in calendar 1996 were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  3,410,060   up   7.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		2,796,839   up   9.4 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	613,221   down 0.1 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    2,135,276   up  3.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		1,434,932   up  2.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	700,344   up  6.7 percent</p>
<p> Exports	     1,276,662   up  6.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		 968,546   up 10.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	308,116 down  4.5 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output   1,346,063   up  7.4 percent</p>
<p>Toyota's statistics for December were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	    260,614   up 16.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		  216,568   up 18.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 44,046   up  6.8 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales	172,973   up 20.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		  110,073   up 14.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 62,900   up 32.5 percent</p>
<p> Exports		  87,445 down 17.4 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		  67,458 down 14.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus	 19,987 down 25.2 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output	92,413  up   9.2 percent</p>
</text>
